title: NewYarnScript
---
<<show_date_cutscene "Day1">>
<<vn_set_background "classroom day">>
<<vn_show_sprite "Kaede" "normal">>
Kaede: Good morning.
Kaede: .......
<<vn_show_sprite "Kaede" "confused">>
Kaede: Why you still standing at here?
->I'm just thinking something
    <<vn_show_sprite "Kaede" "normal">>
    Kaede:...ok
->I'm watching you
    Kaede:...?

<<vn_set_background "corridor day">>
Hiragi: Watch out!
<<vn_show_sprite "Kaede" "normal">>
Kaede: ...!

<<vn_hide_sprite>>
Hiragi:Ouch....
Hiragi: (I didn't see her just now...is she okay?)
<<vn_show_sprite "Kaede" "normal">>
Hiragi: Are you ok?
Kaede:....
<<vn_hide_sprite>>
Hiragi: By the way, this is...
->a drawing book?
    <<vn_show_sprite "Kaede" "normal">>
    Kaede:.....
->I help you to pick up
    <<vn_show_sprite "Kaede" "smile">>
    Kaede:...Thank you.

<<jump SecondDay>>
